      "item": [
        {
          "id": "1630f796-fa23-4355-9ef0-d331669877f4",
          "name": "Return all the authorization models for a particular store",
          "request": {
            "name": "Return all the authorization models for a particular store",
            "description": {
              "content": "The ReadAuthorizationModels API will return all the authorization models for a certain store.\nOpenFGA's response will contain an array of all authorization models, sorted in descending order of creation.\n\n## Example\nAssume that a store's authorization model has been configured twice. To get all the authorization models that have been created in this store, call GET authorization-models. The API will return a response that looks like:\n```json\n{\n  \"authorization_models\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"01G50QVV17PECNVAHX1GG4Y5NC\",\n      \"type_definitions\": [...]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"01G4ZW8F4A07AKQ8RHSVG9RW04\",\n      \"type_definitions\": [...]\n    },\n  ],\n  \"continuation_token\": \"eyJwayI6IkxBVEVTVF9OU0NPTkZJR19hdXRoMHN0b3JlIiwic2siOiIxem1qbXF3MWZLZExTcUoyN01MdTdqTjh0cWgifQ==\"\n}\n```\nIf there are no more authorization models available, the `continuation_token` field will be empty\n```json\n{\n  \"authorization_models\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"01G50QVV17PECNVAHX1GG4Y5NC\",\n      \"type_definitions\": [...]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"01G4ZW8F4A07AKQ8RHSVG9RW04\",\n      \"type_definitions\": [...]\n    },\n  ],\n  \"continuation_token\": \"\"\n}\n```\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "stores",
                ":store_id",
                "authorization-models"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "description": {
                    "content": "",
                    "type": "text/plain"
                  },
                  "key": "page_size",
                  "value": ""
                },
                {
                  "description": {
                    "content": "",
                    "type": "text/plain"
                  },
                  "key": "continuation_token",
                  "value": ""
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "",
                  "key": "store_id",
                  "description": "(Required) "
                },
                {
                  "description": "Auth0 domain",
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "{{auth0_domain}}",
                  "key": "auth0_domain"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": null
